# T4 · 선택 반전(10-05 §48 · f214492): 1행 선택 → edit.select_invert → 나머지 2행 선택 · 다시 반전 → 처음 1행.
id: select-invert
title: 선택 반전 · 두 번이면 원래대로
tree: file a.txt 3
tree: file b.txt 4
tree: file c.txt 5
settings: ui.lang=en
cmd: @ready:list.select:0
cmd: @ready:edit.select_invert
cmd: @ready:list.dump:<out>/inv1.txt
cmd: @ready:assert.panel:rows 3 selected 2
cmd: @ready:edit.select_invert
cmd: @ready:list.dump:<out>/inv2.txt
cmd: @ready:assert.panel:rows 3 selected 1
cmd: @ready:quit
check: inv1.txt: *b.txt
check: inv1.txt: *c.txt
check: inv1.txt: !*a.txt
check: inv2.txt: *a.txt
check: inv2.txt: !*b.txt
